  "notes": "COMPOUND: {録|ろく} (record) + {画|が} (image)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{録画|ろくが}する (to record video)\n・{録画|ろくが}{予約|よやく} (scheduled recording)\n・{録画|ろくが}{再生|さいせい} (playback)\n・{録画|ろくが}を{消|け}す (to delete a recording)\n・{録画|ろくが}{時間|じかん} (recording time)\n\nCONTRAST:\n・{録画|ろくが} - video recording\n・{録音|ろくおん} - audio recording\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n・{再生|さいせい} (playback)\n・HDDレコーダー (HDD recorder)\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
